                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S^{n-1} = \partial D^n \coloneqq \{ \vec x\in \mathbb{R}^n | \; {\vert \vec x \vert = 1}\} \hookrightarrow \mathbb{R}^n
                  for its
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/boundary"} boundary
                  = succeed "." do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/n-sphere"} n-sphere
            %p
              Notice that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
