                    \\,.
            %p
              Notice that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mover
                      %mi η
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ˜
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \tilde \eta
              is a basepoint preserving
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/left+homotopy"} left homotopy
              from
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi α
                    %mo =
                    %mover
                      %mi η
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ˜
                    %msub
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                      %mn 1
