          #RemarkOnChoicesOfNonGoodPathAndCylinderObjects.num_remark
            %h6#remark_12 Remark
            %p
              For every object
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                    %mo ∈
                    %mi 𝒞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X \in \mathcal{C}
              in a model category, a cylinder object and a path space object according to def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#PathAndCylinderObjectsInAModelCategory"}
              exist: the factorization axioms guarantee that there exists
            %ol
              %li
                %p
                  a factorization of the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/codiagonal"} codiagonal
                  as
                .maruku-equation
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
