            %p
              The cylinder and path space objects obtained this way are actually better than required by def.
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#PathAndCylinderObjectsInAModelCategory"}
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
