              is a fibration. Such authors would then refer to the concept in def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#PathAndCylinderObjectsInAModelCategory"}
              as “good” cylinder/path-space objects.
            %p
              The terminology in def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#PathAndCylinderObjectsInAModelCategory"}
              follows the original (
              %a{:href => "#Quillen67"}> Quillen 67, I.1 def. 4
              ). With the induced concept of left/right homotopy below in def.
