                    %mi X
                    %mo ×
                    %mi X
                    %mo →
                    %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} p_i \colon Path(X)\to X \times X \to X
              is the composite of two fibrations, and hence itself a fibration, by prop.
              = succeed "." do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ClosurePropertiesOfInjectiveAndProjectiveMorphisms"}
