                    \\emptyset
                    \\\
                    {}^{\mathllap{\in Cof}}\downarrow &amp; \searrow^{\mathrlap{\in Cof}}
                    \\\
                    Q X &amp;\underset{\in W \cap Cof}{\longrightarrow}&amp; P Q X &amp;\underset{\in Fib}{\longrightarrow}&amp; \ast
                    \\\
                    {}^{\mathllap{\in W}}\downarrow
                    \\\
                    X
                    }
                    \\,.
            %p
              Now to see that the image on morphisms is well defined. First observe that any two choices
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi Q
