              equivalently as the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/localization"} localization
              also of these subcategories with weak equivalences, at their weak equivalences. In particular there are
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivalences+of+categories"} equivalences of categories
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Ho
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
