          %p
            (
            %a{:href => "classical+model+structure+on+topological+spaces#Piacenza91"}> Piacenza 91, theorem 5.4
            )
          .proof
            %h6#proof_57 Proof
            %p
              By prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#TopologicallyEnrichedCopresheavesHaveAllLimitsAndColimits"}
              the category has all limits and colimits, hence it remains to check the model structure.
            %p
              But via the enriched Yoneda lemma (prop.
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#TopologicallyEnrichedYonedaLemma"}
              = succeed "," do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#TopQuillenModelStructure"}
              = succeed "." do
