              that has the right lifting property against the elements of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msubsup
                      %mi I
                      %mi Top
                      %mi 𝒞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} I_{Top}^{\mathcal{C}}
              is a projective weak equivalence, follows by noticing that for fixed
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi η
                    %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace"} :
                    %mi F
                    %mo →
                    %mi G
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \eta \colon F \to G
              the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/enriched+Yoneda+lemma"} enriched Yoneda lemma
              prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#TopologicallyEnrichedYonedaLemma"}
