            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#HomotopyFiber"}
            is a special case of the more general concept of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+pullbacks"} homotopy pullbacks
          #RightProperModelCategory.num_defn
            %h6#definition_61 Definition
            %p
              A
