              square precisely if the opposite edge is a weak equivalence, too.
          .proof
            %h6#proof_74 Proof
            %p Consider a commuting square of the form
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
